115
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:23,197
How I've longed for your
delicate features your

116
00:08:23,280 --> 00:08:25,857
soft skin to hear the
intoxicating words resting

117
00:08:25,940 --> 00:08:29,557
on your sweet lips it

